# again on the next format — a loop with no winner.
packages/db/migrations/meta/

# Generated artifacts (P0-62, P0-63).
#
# Both are compared byte-for-byte against a regeneration in CI, so anything
# that rewrites them breaks that check — and lint-staged runs prettier --write
# on every staged .json and .md, so this is not hypothetical: the drift check
# would fail on the commit that introduced it.
docs/api/openapi.json
docs/api/consumers.md

# Claude Code's scratch worktrees.
#
# Checkouts of this same repository, created under `.claude/worktrees/` when an
# agent needs an isolated tree. `.git/info/exclude` keeps them out of git, but
# that file is local and Prettier does not read it — so without this line
# `pnpm format:check` fails on somebody else's checkout of the same code, and
# the fix looks like formatting the whole repository.
.claude/
